 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "totalTask, totalModel, totalHuman and k are positive integers and schedule is a list of string triples [task, model, human]. The schedule is valid when every triple names a task \"t<i>\" with 1 <= i <= totalTask, a model \"m<j>\" with 1 <= j <= totalModel and a human \"h<l>\" with 1 <= l <= totalHuman (decimal without leading zeros), every task appears in exactly k triples, and no two triples of the same task share a human or share a model. Return whether schedule is valid.",
